// BaselScript action definitions
//
// Format:
// name;match;parameter_rule;runtime_requirement;syntax
//
// match:
//   Exact   = the action name must match completely
//   Prefix  = runtime-compatible StartsWith(...) family
//
// parameter_rule:
//   None            = no migrated static parameter rule
//   CallTarget      = validate CALL <type>=<name>
//   NonEmpty        = action requires non-empty content
//   CryptoValueKey  = action requires value= and key=
//
// runtime_requirement:
//   None
//   ApplicationDatabase
//   SystemDatabase
//
// syntax:
//   descriptive action syntax for validator hints / docs / AI
//   '-' means not documented yet
//
// STEP19 note:
// syntax is metadata. It is not a new blocking grammar.
//
// Action names are matched case-insensitively by ActionValidator.
// Prefix order is significant when prefixes overlap.

array;Exact;None;None;-
add;Exact;None;None;-
change;Exact;None;None;-
clear;Exact;None;None;-
close;Exact;None;None;-
const;Exact;None;None;-
copy;Exact;None;None;-
